---
const today = new Date();
---

<footer>
	<p>&copy; {today.getFullYear()} 人间过客 · 记录、整理，以及一些想讲给你听的故事</p>
	<p class="meta">
		<a href="https://github.com/TokiAskara/tokiaskara.github.io" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
		<span>·</span>
		<a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
		<span>·</span>
		<span>用 Astro 构建</span>
	</p>
</footer>

<style>
	footer {
		max-width: 1080px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2.5em 1.2em 3em;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
		text-align: center;
	}
	footer p {
		margin: 0 0 0.6em;
		color: var(--stone);
		font-size: 0.92rem;
	}
	footer .meta {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 0.6em;
	}
	footer a {
		color: var(--olive);
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	footer a:hover {
		color: var(--terra);
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-underline-offset: 3px;
	}
</style>
